// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`fixture: onboarding page > projects Markdown for agents 1`] = `
"# Deploying the billing service

> How billing goes from a merged PR to production.

## Before you start

> **Production access** (warning): You need the \`deployer\` role. Ask in #platform if you don't have it.

Meetings start at 10:30 and the ratio:high flag stays literal.

## Install

### npm

\`\`\`sh
npm i -g @acme/deploy
\`\`\`

### pnpm

\`\`\`sh
pnpm add -g @acme/deploy
\`\`\`

## Ship it

1. **Tag** the release with \`acme tag\`.
2. **Watch** the canary dashboard for 10 minutes.
3. **Promote** with \`acme promote\`.

_Diagram: Release path_

\`\`\`mermaid
flowchart LR
  PR --> Canary --> Prod
\`\`\`

**Why canaries?**

A canary takes 5% of traffic, so a bad release hurts few users.

| Env  | Region    |
| ---- | --------- |
| prod | eu-west-1 |
"
`;

exports[`fixture: onboarding page > renders HTML for people 1`] = `
